## OAuth Flow & Token Management

Users authenticate via LinkedIn OAuth. The backend exchanges authorization codes for access and refresh tokens. Tokens are encrypted before storage and refreshed automatically by the integration module when required.

Tokens are never stored in plaintext and never sent back to the client after initial authorization.

